# ledgerlite configuration
#
# ledgerlite needs NO API keys, NO third-party services and NO network access
# to run. Every feature works fully offline against a single local SQLite
# file at ./data/ledger.db.
#
# If you set variables below, export them in your shell before starting the
# server, or copy this file to `.env` and source it.
#
# PORT              HTTP port the server listens on              (default: 8000)
# LEDGERLITE_DB     Override the SQLite database path            (default: data/ledger.db)
#
# Example:
#   PORT=8137
#   LEDGERLITE_DB=/var/lib/ledgerlite/ledger.db
